title: Volcano Balloon & Treasures
story: dungeo
description: Melt glacier, fly balloon through volcano, collect 4 treasures
  (ruby, coin, stamp, crown). Restores from wt-14.

---

# Restore state from wt-14 (player at Living Room with torch and lantern)
# Living Room floor has: guidebook, matchbook, brick, shiny wire
$restore wt-14

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Gather volcano supplies from Living Room floor
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Gather volcano supplies]

> take guidebook

> take matchbook

> take brick

> take shiny wire

> inventory

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Navigate to Glacier Room and melt glacier
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Melt glacier to open path to Ruby Room]

# Navigate to Egyptian Room
# Living Room → Cellar → Troll Room → E/W Passage → Deep Ravine → Rocky Crawl → Egyptian Room
> down

> east

> north

> north

> west

> northwest

# Turn on lantern (backup light - torch will be lost when thrown at glacier)
> turn on lantern

# Go up to Glacier Room
> up

# Throw the lit torch at the glacier to melt it
# Torch gets carried to Stream View by meltwater, glacier removed, WEST exit opens
> throw torch at glacier

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get ruby from Ruby Room and reach Volcano Bottom
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get ruby and reach Volcano Bottom]

# West exit now open after glacier melt
> west

> take ruby

> west

> south

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Prepare balloon for flight
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Launch balloon]

> enter balloon

> open receptacle

# Light the guidebook with matchbook, then put in receptacle to inflate balloon
> burn guidebook

> put guidebook in receptacle

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Fly to Narrow Ledge - collect coin and stamp
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Dock at Narrow Ledge and collect treasures]

# Wait for balloon to rise from vair1 to vair2 (daemon fires every 3 turns)
> wait

> wait

> wait

# At vair2 near Narrow Ledge - tie wire to hook to dock
> tie braided wire to hook

# Exit balloon to Narrow Ledge
> exit

# Collect zorkmid coin from ledge
> take coin

# Visit Library to get stamp from purple book
> south

> take book

> take stamp

# Return to Narrow Ledge and re-enter balloon
> north

> enter balloon

# Untie wire to resume flight
> untie braided wire from hook

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Fly to Wide Ledge
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Dock at Wide Ledge]

# Rise from vair2 to vair3 (3 turns)
> wait

> wait

> wait

# Rise from vair3 to vair4 (3 more turns)
> wait

> wait

> wait

# At vair4 near Wide Ledge - tie wire to dock
> tie braided wire to hook

# Exit balloon to Wide Ledge
> exit

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Dusty Room - blow open safe, get crown
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get crown from Dusty Room]

# Go south to Dusty Room
> south

# Put the brick in the slot (hole in safe) for the explosion
> put brick in hole

# Light the fuse wire - 2 turn countdown to explosion
> burn wire

# Escape north to Wide Ledge before explosion
> north

# Wait for explosion (fuse burns for 2 turns total)
> wait

# Return to Dusty Room - safe is now blown open
> south

# Take the crown from the now-open safe
> take crown

# Escape north before room collapse (SAFIN = 5 turns after explosion)
> north

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store all volcano treasures in trophy case
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Store volcano treasures in trophy case]

# Re-enter balloon for descent
> enter balloon

# Close receptacle to cut heat source (guidebook still burning after ~30 turns of 200)
> close receptacle

# Untie wire to begin descent (no heat = balloon descends)
> untie wire

# Descent: ledg4 → vair4 (on untie), then vair4 → vair3 (3 turns)
> wait

> wait

> wait

# vair3 → vair2 (3 turns)
> wait

> wait

> wait

# vair2 → vair1 (3 turns)
> wait

> wait

> wait

# vair1 → vlbot (3 turns)
> wait

> wait

> wait

# Exit balloon at Volcano Bottom
> exit

# Walk back: Volcano Bottom → Lava → Ruby → Glacier → Egyptian → Rocky Crawl
# → Deep Ravine → E/W Passage → Troll Room → Cellar → Living Room
> north

> west

> south

# Detour north to Stream View to recover the torch (carried there by meltwater)
# Stream View ↔ Glacier Room is a N↔N connection
> north

> take torch

> north

> east

> east

> west

> south

> west

> west

> up

> open trophy case

> put ruby in trophy case

> put coin in trophy case

> put stamp in trophy case

> put crown in trophy case

> put trunk in trophy case

> put torch in trophy case

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Verify final state
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Verify state for next segment]

> inventory

> look

> score

# Dump full score ledger for debugging
> gdt

> ds ledger

> ex

# Bank lantern battery while in the lit Living Room — the torch is gone
# (thrown at the glacier), so the battery must last through wt-16 and the
# wt-17 endgame. wt-16 turns the lantern back on before descending.
> turn off lantern

[END GOAL]

$save wt-15
